### user top items get all - Artists (medium term)
GET {{EC.Spotify.HostAddress}}/User/top?userTopType=1&userTopTimeRange=1
Accept: application/json

### user top items get all - Tracks (short term)
GET {{EC.Spotify.HostAddress}}/User/top?userTopType=2&userTopTimeRange=2
Accept: application/json

### user top items get all - Tracks (long term, paged)
GET {{EC.Spotify.HostAddress}}/User/top?userTopType=2&userTopTimeRange=0&offset=0&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### user top items get all raw - Artists (medium term)
GET {{EC.Spotify.HostAddress}}/User/top/raw?userTopType=1&userTopTimeRange=1
Accept: application/json

### user top items get all raw - Tracks (short term)
GET {{EC.Spotify.HostAddress}}/User/top/raw?userTopType=2&userTopTimeRange=2
Accept: application/json

### user top items get all raw - Tracks (long term, paged)
GET {{EC.Spotify.HostAddress}}/User/top/raw?userTopType=2&userTopTimeRange=0&offset=0&limit=20
Accept: application/json
